eam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3715400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magical game of exploration and discovery, crafted by 2 passionate indie devs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Dig into Peace with Cozy Holes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Digby, a magical shovel with a heart full of hope, on a cozy journey to reunite with his long-lost tribe. After a devastating calamity buried Digby and forced his family underground, the tropical island has healed\u2014but the tribe remains trapped below. It\u2019s up to you to dig through vibrant biomes, uncover ancient carvings, and follow a spiral-marked path to a heartfelt reunion that will warm your soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Cozy Gamers Will Love This Adventure:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A Digging Escape Like No Other: Dig almost anywhere and reshape the island! Tunnel through layers of loose sand, glowing crystals, and molten metal\u2014each biome a cozy masterpiece waiting to be explored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/4559ac4029fed06ed8f60635bba11dcd.poster.avif?t=1772214990\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/4559ac4029fed06ed8f60635bba11dcd.webm?t=1772214990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/4559ac4029fed06ed8f60635bba11dcd.mp4?t=1772214990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A Story Told Through Carvings:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the tribe\u2019s journey through emotive environmental storytelling, infused with magic and whimsey at its core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/a1f2639ab2759c83f78948724c8af2a2.poster.avif?t=1772214990\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/a1f2639ab2759c83f78948724c8af2a2.webm?t=1772214990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/a1f2639ab2759c83f78948724c8af2a2.mp4?t=1772214990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Relaxing Progression, No Stress:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Digby\u2019s abilities (Dig Speed, Shovel Toughness, and more) with a streamlined system\u2014no inventory, no busywork, just pure cozy fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/33d12183ff410127c93f264a73ea9a5f.poster.avif?t=1772214990\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/33d12183ff410127c93f264a73ea9a5f.webm?t=1772214990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/extras/33d12183ff410127c93f264a73ea9a5f.mp4?t=1772214990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A Whimsical World for You:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sunlit beaches to underground caverns, every dig feels like a warm hug, crafted for gamers who crave peace and wonder. There's no death, no stress, no timers, and no forced way to play the game...its up to you!</p>","developers":["FlashPoint Games, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616250/7829a312e710b714ea2e43bb824cf7b2a2ec5002/header.jpg?t=1772214990","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Flashpoint Games, LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3616250/924189896/72b245785eda7f05ff95cf86c58a32a4b85394d1/1753624383/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753637470","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3616250/924189896/72b245785eda7f05ff95cf86c58a32a4b85394d1/1753624383/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753637470","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3616250/924189896/72b245785eda7f05ff95cf86c58a32a4b85394d1/1753624383/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753637470","id":257174486,"name":"Cozy Holes Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174486/01cb66f9be1f40c16104e7f836ba554ce8280a6f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753637470"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3616250/1084746748/17d5a92d04ead203baf7082ac6690a79a0dca0e3/1750453176/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749689628","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3616250/1084746748/17d5a92d04ead203baf7082ac6690a79a0dca0e3/1750453176/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749689628","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https